  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cattle Feedlot Company Limited</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cattle Feedlot Company (CFC) is a Malawian operating company which owns three farms totalling 3,700 hectares in Malawi. This includes over 1,200 hectares of irrigated sugarcane, 335 hectares of which are run as a trust farm for local communities.&#xA0; The land is owned by an agricultural development and farm services management company with an extensive track record of managing and owning operations across Southern Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
